3. Fixed Jenkins + Docker Permission Issue
Problem:
permission denied while trying to connect to the docker API
Solution:
sudo usermod -aG docker jenkinssudo systemctl restart jenkinssudo systemctl restart dockersudo chmod 666 /var/run/docker.sock

